# The data is staged here and published as release assets, never committed:
# a release asset can be replaced, while a 20 MB binary in the history is in
# every clone for ever.
#
# What stays tracked is the text that defines a release — the manifest, the
# attribution and the release notes. They are small, they are the contract an
# app is written against, and one of them is the licence notice CC BY-SA
# obliges us to keep with the data.
*.db
*.db.gz
*.gz
*.zip
.DS_Store
